    "overview": "KINGNET is a self-contained cyber range. Buy lab domains + target orgs with\n"
                "KingCoins, phish them, steal sessions, take over accounts — then learn the\n"
                "defenses (passkeys, detection, step-up). Everything runs locally in Docker and\n"
